{"4220730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Medals Of Valor: Last Stand", "steam_appid": 4220730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5003260], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-School WW2 Shooter With PSX Retro Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced retro, World War II FPS inspired by classic PSX shooters. Gritty visuals, chunky pixels, and pure arcade action—no waiting, no lobbies, just jump in and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo With Smart Bots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always playable: fight up to 24 AI soldiers that run, flank, hide, and use classes and perks like real players. Unlock gear and progress even in bot-only matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/ff2fc758c8d4f61edc3e56ccf15842fe.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/ff2fc758c8d4f61edc3e56ccf15842fe.webm?t=1787702448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online PvP or Private Matches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch and Free-For-All with real players. Up to 24 players per match. Bots fill empty slots so the game never dies. Create private lobbies for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/03885aa8c9c1bb7577c006fa5ccd9684.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/03885aa8c9c1bb7577c006fa5ccd9684.webm?t=1787702448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Soldier:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infantry, Recon, Paratrooper, Tank Crew, and more (US, Russian, German...).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/5d43b00d40be16b2547e1ff387667ddc.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/5d43b00d40be16b2547e1ff387667ddc.webm?t=1787702448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classes, Weapons &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use SMGs, rifles, snipers, LMGs, shotguns, pistols, and grenades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your build with perks and attachments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/71d8ef08ea8f86088c77814c39a50409.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/71d8ef08ea8f86088c77814c39a50409.webm?t=1787702448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For WW2 Fans. For Retro PSX Fans.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to classic WW2 shooters with PSX-style graphics, fast gunfights, and old-school simplicity. If you enjoy low-poly nostalgia, arcade action, or timeless WW2 FPS gameplay—this is your battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎖️<strong>Wishlist now to support development and get notified at launch!</strong>🎖️</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Old-School WW2 Shooter With PSX Retro Vibes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced retro, World War II FPS inspired by classic PSX shooters. Gritty visuals, chunky pixels, and pure arcade action—no waiting, no lobbies, just jump in and fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Solo With Smart Bots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always playable: fight up to 24 AI soldiers that run, flank, hide, and use classes and perks like real players. Unlock gear and progress even in bot-only matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/ff2fc758c8d4f61edc3e56ccf15842fe.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/ff2fc758c8d4f61edc3e56ccf15842fe.webm?t=1787702448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online PvP or Private Matches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team Deathmatch and Free-For-All with real players. Up to 24 players per match. Bots fill empty slots so the game never dies. Create private lobbies for you and your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/03885aa8c9c1bb7577c006fa5ccd9684.poster.avif?t=1787702448\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220730/extras/03885aa8c9c1bb7577c006fa5ccd9684.webm?t=1